  "notes": "SID, GAAP-basis governmental funds statement (p2) Total column used for receipts/disbursements; Total column of Governmental Funds Balance Sheet cash is the same as Net Position cash (876,311). Balance sheet uses the Statement of Net Position column (government-wide). Bonds issued 950,000 = debt_proceeds; Warrants Retired (860,327) = other_financing. Depreciation appears only in the reconciliation column and is excluded. Detail uses the Actual on GAAP Basis column of the budget schedules (ties to the statement); lines printed as '-' with a budget are recorded as 0. Detail duplicates the statement funds by design. Original and Final Budget are one column. Deferred inflows (unavailable property tax) recorded with category deferred inflows. Read pages 1-5 of 5"
